\[
\operatorname{Cov}\left[x_1, x_2\right]=7.75-6.875=0.875
\]

Hence \(C_{11}=1.25+0.6875+2 \times 0.875=3.6875\).

In a similar way, we work out \(C_{22} = 3.1875\).

